  "body": "POSITION. Right in the heart of Orewa, where everything you love is just an easy flat stroll away. Morning walks along the beach, coffee at your favourite café, boutique shopping and everyday amenities, all on your doorstep. Leave the car at home and enjoy the freedom of having it all so close.\r\n\r\nPRIVACY. Imagine morning coffee in your own peaceful garden, afternoons relaxing in the sunshine or entertaining friends in complete privacy. With generous living spaces, effortless indoor-outdoor flow and a beautiful, fully fenced garden, there's room to truly feel at home. Freshly painted throughout, with new carpet, oven, hob and external spouting, simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nPOTENTIAL. This freehold property offers more than meets the eye! With room for the motorhome or boat, existing plans to convert the layout into a three-bedroom home, and Business Mixed Use zoning, there's exciting flexibility for the future.\r\n\r\n• Freehold brick & tile home, solid, practical and easy care\r\n• Privately positioned with a fully fenced garden\r\n• Two generous double bedrooms, with plans for a potential third\r\n• Spacious living and dining with a modern kitchen\r\n• Freshly painted throughout, with new carpet, oven, hob and external spouting\r\n• Modern bathroom with a large walk-in shower\r\n• Generous off-street parking with room for the motorhome or boat, and plenty of storage\r\n• Business Mixed Use zoning offering future flexibility\r\n• Easy flat stroll to Orewa Beach, cafés, shops and amenities\r\n\r\nTHE RIGHT POSITION. YOUR OWN PRIVACY. ROOM FOR WHAT'S NEXT.\r\nImagine the freedom of a home that's ready to enjoy from day one, with space for the things you love and options for whatever the future brings.\r\n\r\nMove straight in, make yourself at home and enjoy the best of Orewa living.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: 4:00 PM, WEDNESDAY 2 DECEMBER 2026 (unless sold prior).\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of these particulars, no warranty is given by the vendor or the agent as to their accuracy. Interested parties should not rely on these particulars as representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise. Although high standards have been used in preparing this document, no legal responsibility can be accepted for any loss or damage resulting from the content or use of this information. Any photographs show only certain parts of the property as they appeared when taken, and some photographs may have been digitally enhanced for marketing purposes. Areas, amounts, measurements, distances, and all other numerical information are approximate only.",
